            "review_title": "Review at Hot Taste",
            "review_text": "Jessica R\nRome, Italy24 contributions\n0\nDelicious foods and fantastic service\nNov 2016 • Solo\nSearched for a place near my hotel and this place popped up. And what afind! young staff who are super happy to help, and my waiter spoke good english and advised me on dishes etc. I asked for take away, and was given a seat to wait. The food was really delicious and really good price. I will be coming back.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 18, 2016",
